  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Keck Graduate Institute (KGI), part of the Claremont Colleges consortium, is one of the higher education institutions to prepare graduates for careers in the biotech, pharmaceutical, genetics, and healthcare sectors. KGI is known globally for its strong relationships with companies like Amgen, Pfizer, Genentech, and biotech firms across Southern California.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>KGI offers a tight-knit, collaborative, and supportive student community. You’ll find clubs such as the KGI Student Government and Health &amp; Wellness groups.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>KGI offers housing options on campus, the Oasis KGI Commons. It includes an open outdoor plaza, student lounges, a swimming pool, and more.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>On campus, you get access to millions of digital and physical resources, databases, and more.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>You can use the athletic facilities on campus, which include gyms, swimming pools, courts, and fields.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>Keck Graduate Institute (KGI) features research labs focused on biotechnology, bioengineering, genomics, and more.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>Since KGI is part of the Claremont Colleges, you can enjoy access to all shared dining halls and cafes, including the Claremont Colleges’ Dining Halls.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
